      "reason": "A1 separates the objective (whether to invest, based on demand, willingness to pay and competitive position) from the suggested solution. It lists real alternatives, including no expansion, a new route to market and a different B2B group (small trades). It states budget and time constraints. It does not challenge the premise or surface a missed constraint, such as the dossier's lack of any Testo consumer data, so it does not reach 3."
